# MemSentinel GCC Plugin Auto-Loading Specs File
# This file instructs GCC/G++ to load the MemSentinel plugin by default for all compilations.
# To disable MemSentinel, pass -fplugin-arg-memsentinel-disable to gcc/g++.

*cc1_options:
+ %{!fplugin-arg-memsentinel-disable:%{!fplugin-arg-memcheck-disable:-fplugin=memsentinel}}

*cc1plus_options:
+ %{!fplugin-arg-memsentinel-disable:%{!fplugin-arg-memcheck-disable:-fplugin=memsentinel}}

*link:
+ %{!fplugin-arg-memsentinel-disable:%{!fplugin-arg-memcheck-disable:%{!nodefaultlibs:%{!nostdlib:-lmemsentinel_rt}}}}
